# Scratch and caches. NOTE what is deliberately NOT here: `data/` and
# `weights/` are tracked. An earlier version ignored both wholesale, which
# silently excluded the frozen motif bank, the split assignment and the
# delivered checkpoints -- the three things a result cannot be reproduced
# without. Large external inputs are reached through HYPPE_DATA_ROOT and
# never live in the tree, so a blanket ignore buys nothing.
_work/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Per-run output. `results/` is tracked (it is the evidence behind the docs);
# `runs/` is where training writes its own checkpoints and logs.
runs/
